@startuml Notes Application Sequence Diagram
title Notes Application - User Sync Flow

actor "User" as U
participant "Web Client" as WC
participant "API Gateway" as AG
participant "Auth Service" as AS
participant "Notes Service" as NS
participant "Database" as DB

== Initial Access ==
U -> WC : Access notes app
WC -> AG : GET /api/notes (no auth header)
AG -> NS : Forward request
NS -> DB : Query notes
DB --> NS : Return all notes
NS --> AG : Return notes data
AG --> WC : Return notes data
WC --> U : Display notes

== User Login ==
U -> WC : Enter credentials
WC -> AG : POST /api/login
AG -> AS : Validate credentials
AS --> AG : Return auth token
AG --> WC : Return auth token
WC -> WC : Store token

== Sync Notes ==
U -> WC : Click sync button
WC -> AG : POST /api/notes/sync (with token)
AG -> AS : Validate token
AS --> AG : Token valid
AG -> NS : Process sync request
NS -> DB : Update notes
DB --> NS : Confirmation
NS --> AG : Sync complete
AG --> WC : Sync success
WC --> U : Show success message

== Create Note ==
U -> WC : Create new note
WC -> AG : POST /api/notes/create
note right: No input validation
AG -> NS : Create note
NS -> DB : Insert note
note right: No audit logging
DB --> NS : Note created
NS --> AG : Note created
AG --> WC : Note created
WC --> U : Show new note

== Export Notes ==
U -> WC : Export all notes
WC -> AG : GET /api/notes/export
note right: No rate limiting
AG -> NS : Export request
NS -> DB : Query all notes
DB --> NS : All notes data
NS --> AG : Export file
AG --> WC : Export file
WC --> U : Download file

== Error Handling ==
U -> WC : Invalid input
WC -> AG : POST /api/notes/create
AG -> NS : Process request
NS -> DB : Insert attempt
DB --> NS : Error: "Password field contains invalid characters"
note right: Sensitive data in error
NS --> AG : Error response
AG --> WC : Error message
WC --> U : Show error

== Security Weaknesses ==
U -> WC : Login (no 2FA)
WC -> AG : POST /api/login
AG -> AS : Validate credentials (no 2FA check)
AS --> AG : Return auth token
AG --> WC : Return auth token

U -> WC : Multiple failed logins
loop 10 times
    WC -> AG : POST /api/login (wrong password)
    AG --> WC : Error: Invalid credentials
end
' No account lockout or CAPTCHA

U -> WC : Login from new device
WC -> AG : POST /api/login (new device)
AG -> AS : Validate credentials
AS --> AG : Return auth token
AG --> WC : Return auth token
' No notification or alert sent to user

U -> WC : Edit note
WC -> WC : Edit note content
' No autosave implemented

U -> WC : Delete note
WC -> AG : DELETE /api/notes/{id}
' No confirmation dialog before delete

@enduml 